<title>USA: Fannie Mae to redeem $65 mln in 2 issues.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae to redeem $65 mln in 2 issues.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal National Mortgage Association on Monday said it will redeem $65 million in two debenture issues at a price equal to 100 percent of principal amount as follows:</p>
<p>   Principal  Rate    Maturity    Cusip    Redemption</p>
<p> $50 million  6.415   07/10/98  3134AODT6  10/21/96</p>
<p> $15 million  6.43    09/04/98  3134AOJY9  10/21/96</p>
<p>Payment of principal amount plus interest accrued to the redemption date will be made to holders of record as of the close of business on Oct 18, 1996, Fannie Mae said.</p>
</text>
